      "id": "cleanup",
      "title": "The ghost of a screen",
      "subtitle": "You left. Its request didn't.",
      "category": "Effect cleanup",
      "difficulty": "Expert",
      "goal": "Make Project A's late response take over Project B's screen.",
      "hint": "Navigate away while the first project is loading. Let its response arrive last.",
      "explanation": "A component's effect loads details into its parent's shared panel. After navigating, the unmounted component's promise still writes to that panel. Effect cleanup marks the old request inactive, so the fixed version ignores its late result.",
